SClinicFix database migrations
=============================

This directory contains the Alembic migration history managed by
Flask-Migrate.

Migration files are stored in the versions/ directory.

Important safety rules:
- Do not run migrations against production without reviewing them.
- The baseline revision represents the original ClinicFix schema
  from Git commit fd3d829.
- The baseline must not include User.maintenance_staff_id.
- A later revision introduces the optional one-to-one relationship
  between User and MaintenanceStaff.

Existing databases must have their schema verified against the
baseline before the baseline revision is recorded as applied.

Preparing migration files does not apply them to any database.